<ContentLayout title="About TokenCalculator.dev" description="Why TokenCalculator.dev measures LLM tokens locally and labels estimates honestly." heading="About"><p>TokenCalculator.dev is a small developer tool for checking prompt size, input cost, and context fit before calling an LLM API.</p><p>It was built around three rules: content stays on your device, estimates are labeled honestly, and pricing provenance remains visible.</p><h2>Open model data</h2><p>Current pricing and context limits are refreshed from the open-source <a href="https://models.dev/">Models.dev</a> catalog. A bundled registry keeps the calculator usable when that public catalog cannot be reached.</p></ContentLayout>
